      </div>
      <ol class="horizon-decision">
        <li><span>01</span><strong>{t('先不在提示词里硬禁 next / back', 'Do not hard-ban next / back in the prompt first')}</strong><p>{t('硬禁会同时改变提示词和动作选择规则，分不清问题到底是步数不够，还是我们把行为教偏了。', 'A hard ban would change both the prompt and the action rule, making it unclear whether the issue was short horizon or an artificial steering effect.')}</p></li>
        <li><span>02</span><strong>{t('采用第二种方案：保持原提示词，只把 15 步改成 30 步', 'Use the second plan: keep the prompt fixed and change only 15 steps to 30')}</strong><p>{t('这样只测试“多给时间有没有用”，不把提示词修改混进同一个实验。', 'This isolates whether extra time helps without mixing a prompt intervention into the same test.')}</p></li>
        <li><span>03</span><strong>{t('30 步仍然打转，我们停止继续加步数', 'The 30-step run still loops, so we stop adding more steps')}</strong><p>{t('这一步排除的是“15 步太短”这个具体解释，没有解决最终低分。下一步把动作选择提示词单独拿出来测试，再继续检查动作接口。', 'This rules out the specific explanation that 15 steps were simply too short; it does not solve the final low score. The next test isolates action-selection prompting before continuing to the action channel.')}</p></li>
