      <ol class="prompt-chain-grid">
        <li><span>01</span><div><strong>{t('把“别一直翻页”写成具体动作规则', 'Turn “stop paging” into concrete action rules')}</strong><p>{t('我们做了一版“会看当前页面再决定动作”的提示词（state-aware-v3）：先搜索一次；结果页优先点一个合理商品；连续翻页最多 2 次；商品页先选必要选项再购买；还有别的合法动作时，不要一直重复同一个动作。', 'The state-aware-v3 prompt says: search once; prefer a plausible product before paging; allow at most two consecutive Next actions; select required options before buy now; and avoid repeating the same action when another legal action exists.')}</p></div></li>
        <li><span>02</span><div><strong>{t('第一次测试确实把一个任务从循环带到了购买', 'The first test did move one task from looping to purchase')}</strong><p>{t('H1.8 共 128 次尝试。带着“成功轨迹训练出的参数补丁”的模型，再加 state-aware-v3，在一组 16 次尝试里得到 4 次正向结果，而且全都来自同一个任务 3396；其它对照组都是 0 / 16。', 'H1.8 ran 128 attempts. The existing success adapter + state-aware-v3 produced 4 / 16 positives in one cell, all on task 3396; every other cell was 0 / 16.')}</p></div></li>
        <li><span>03</span><div><strong>{t('换一批随机种子，还是只救回同一个任务', 'New seeds reproduced the rescue on the same task only')}</strong><p>{t('H1.9 换两组独立随机种子再测：state-aware-v3 + 成功轨迹参数补丁一共得到 8 次正向结果，仍然全部来自任务 3396；简短提示词和基础模型对照都是 0。', 'H1.9 repeated with two independent seed blocks: state-aware-v3 + the success adapter produced eight positives, again all on task 3396; compact-prompt and BASE controls stayed at zero.')}</p></div></li>
        <li><span>04</span><div><strong>{t('换到新任务后，这版提示词没有表现出稳定优势', 'On new tasks, the prompt advantage was not selective')}</strong><p>{t('H1.10 换到新任务后也出现了正向结果，但其它对照组也出现了类似结果。于是判断变成：这版提示词确实能改变做题路线，也能救回某个具体任务，但还不能解释为什么整体分数低。', 'H1.10 produced positives on new tasks, but they appeared across multiple arms and showed no selective state-aware-v3 advantage. The judgment therefore changed: the prompt can change trajectories and rescue a specific task, but it is not a general explanation for the low score.')}</p></div></li>
      </ol>
      <p class="prompt-chain-conclusion"><strong>{t('最后保留的科学结论', 'Scientific takeaway')}</strong>{t('不把“禁止翻页 / 返回”硬塞进原实验；把这版会看当前页面的提示词单独拿出来测。它在少数任务上有效，但还没有证明能普遍提高能力。', 'Do not hard-code a next/back ban into the original experiment. Test the page-aware prompt separately. It helped a few tasks, but did not show a general capability gain.')}</p>
      <p class="source-note"><a href={stateAwarePromptHref} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><ExternalBrandMark href={stateAwarePromptHref} /> H1.8 · state-aware-v3 提示词配置</a></p>
      <p class="slide-number">11 / 23</p>
    </div>
