      <h2 id="training-dynamics-title">{t('我们用 3B 做便宜诊断：动作接口修好后，训练过程仍在上升', 'We use 3B as a cheaper diagnostic line: after repairing the action interface, training still rises')}</h2>
      <p class="slide-thesis">{t(`3B 先收集一轮基础经验。旧实验曾经因为动作格式和解析出错而拿到假 0 分；新长跑前，我们把动作执行框架、合法动作限制和不会冲突的动作编码修好。之后 ${dynamics3B.score.length} 个封存轮次里，前 20 轮平均 Score 从 ${earlyScoreMean.toFixed(2)} 提到最后 23 轮平均 ${lateScoreMean.toFixed(2)}；31 次 SD-LoRA 候选训练的损失从 ${firstLoss.toFixed(2)} 降到约 ${lastLoss.toFixed(2)}。`, `The 3B line first collected Stage-1 experience; older experiments exposed invalid-action and parser problems. Before the new long run, we repaired the Harness, ActionPrefixConstraint (legal action-prefix constraint), and injective action encoding (avoids action-code collisions). Across ${dynamics3B.score.length} sealed rounds, mean Score rises from ${earlyScoreMean.toFixed(2)} over the first 20 rounds to ${lateScoreMean.toFixed(2)} over the last 23, while loss across 31 candidate trainings falls from ${firstLoss.toFixed(2)} to about ${lastLoss.toFixed(2)}.`)}</p>
