      <p class="dynamics-boundary">{t(`旧实验里的非法动作和解析失败，是动作接口出了问题；那些 0 分不能直接当成模型真实能力为 0。修好动作执行框架以后，这 ${dynamics3B.acceptedRolloutsTotal.toLocaleString('en-US')} 次正式任务尝试里，没有再出现工程无效、解析修复或非法动作终止。因此“接口一直坏着”这个简单解释可以排除。3B 目前仍没有同样评测方式的冻结终评，所以结果表继续留空。`, `Invalid-action/parser failures in the older run were measurement-interface failures, so their zero scores cannot be read directly as zero model capability. After repairing the Harness, these ${dynamics3B.acceptedRolloutsTotal.toLocaleString('en-US')} formal attempts record zero engineering-invalid, parser-repair, and invalid-action-termination events; a persistently broken interface can therefore be removed from the explanation list. The 3B line still has no same-protocol frozen final.`)}</p>
