      <p class="slide-thesis">{t('这页保留 R97 的只读平台期诊断；下面三项只是线索，用来决定下一步该测什么。后来的 R121 复查显示它没有持续卡住：先回撤，随后恢复。下一页用 R0–R121 的封口数据把问题拆成可验证计划。', 'This slide preserves the R97 read-only plateau diagnostic. A later R121 check shows the run did not remain stuck: it dipped, then recovered. The next slide uses the sealed R0–R121 data to turn the question into a testable plan.')}</p>
      <div class="plateau-grid">
        <article><span>01 · {t('训练仍在继续', 'training continues')}</span><strong>58.35 → 55.36 → 50.83</strong><p>{t('这是 R70–79、R80–89、R90–97 的平均 Score。曲线在抖，最近一段还往下走；这叫平台期，比“训练卡死”更准确。', 'These are the mean Scores for R70–79, R80–89, and R90–97. The curve is noisy and the latest block is lower; plateau is the better description than a stopped run.')}</p></article>
        <article><span>02 · {t('学习材料偏向会做的题', 'training data favors solved tasks')}</span><strong>94 / 98 轮</strong><p>{t('98 轮里有 94 轮，拿去训练 SD-LoRA 的题数，刚好等于“完整成功且记录有效”的题数。最近 20 轮平均只有 8.25 / 16 道题进入训练。也就是说，已经会做的题更容易继续被拿来训练，难题反而更少提供新学习材料。', 'In 94 of 98 rounds, the number of tasks used for SD-LoRA training exactly matched the number of fully successful tasks with valid records. Only 8.25 of 16 tasks enter training on average over the latest 20 rounds, so already-solved tasks keep supplying most of the learning material.')}</p></article>
        <article><span>03 · {t('新更新开始互相拉扯', 'new updates pull in different directions')}</span><strong>cos ≈ −0.046</strong><p>{t('最近 10 次相邻参数更新的平均方向相似度接近 0 且略负，其中 7 / 10 为负；同一批候选更新如果交给影子 GDR 打标签，只有 3 / 10 会被标成“通过”。这说明最近的更新方向比较乱，但还不能据此说 GDR 或 DirectApply 谁更好。', 'Across the latest 10 updates, adjacent parameter-direction cosine averages about −0.046 and is negative in 7 of 10 cases; shadow GDR would pass only 3 of those 10 candidates. This flags unstable update directions, without establishing a GDR or DirectApply winner.')}</p></article>
      </div>
      <div class="plateau-carriers"><span><strong>SD-LoRA · 97</strong>{t(' 次更新', ' updates')}</span><span><strong>Text Memory · 2</strong>{t(' 次更新', ' updates')}</span><span><strong>Agent System · 1</strong>{t(' 次更新', ' update')}</span><span><strong>Skill · 1</strong>{t(' 次更新', ' update')}</span></div>
      <div class="plateau-literature" aria-label={t('和已有研究哪里相似', 'How this resembles prior work')}>
        <strong>{t('论文里也见过两个相似问题', 'Two similar problems appear in prior work')}</strong>
        <p>{t('① Adaptive Auto-Harness：系统一直在更新，任务表现也可能先升后降。② ReasoningBank：只从成功轨迹学习，会漏掉失败里的有用信号。它们和我们现在的现象很像，所以值得据此设计下一步实验；这里只把论文当线索，不能说 R70 后的平台已经找到原因。', '① Adaptive Auto-Harness: an agent system can keep updating while task performance rises and then falls. ② ReasoningBank: learning only from successful trajectories can discard useful signals from failures. These are useful clues for our next experiment, not proof that they explain the R70 plateau.')}</p>
        <span><a href={adaptiveAutoHarnessHref} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><ExternalBrandMark href={adaptiveAutoHarnessHref} />Adaptive Auto-Harness ↗</a> · <a href={reasoningBankHref} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><ExternalBrandMark href={reasoningBankHref} />ReasoningBank ↗</a> · <a href={harnessBenefitPaperHref} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><ExternalBrandMark href={harnessBenefitPaperHref} />{t('会更新 ≠ 一定会受益 ↗', 'Updating ≠ benefiting ↗')}</a></span>
      </div>
      <p class="plateau-decision"><strong>{t('现在怎么做', 'Decision now')}</strong>{t('这些现象让我们先怀疑两件事：训练材料越来越集中在已经会做的题，以及最近几次参数更新越来越不顺着同一个方向走。但平台真正为什么出现，还没有证明。当前 DirectApply 先按原规则跑完 R160；下一条实验仍保持每轮 128 次任务尝试，只把更多尝试机会给“已经接近成功、但还没完全做对”的难题。若还是平台，再分别测试“让部分得分也能参与学习”和“用偏好反馈帮助学习”。', 'These clues make us look first at two possibilities: training material may be narrowing, and recent updates may be pulling in less-consistent directions. They do not prove the cause of the plateau. Keep the current DirectApply treatment unchanged through R160. The next experiment keeps the same 128-task-attempt budget and gives more attempts to hard tasks that are close to success. If the plateau remains, test learning from partial scores and preference feedback separately.')}</p>
      <p class="source-note"><a href={directApplyPlateauEvidenceHref}>{t('10:38 SGT 平台期数据快照', '10:38 SGT plateau data snapshot')}</a> · <span>{t('这些线索只用来决定下一步测什么；冻结终评还没打开', 'These clues guide the next test; the frozen final is still locked')}</span></p>
