  <section id="technical-work-summary" class="briefing-slide tone-paper" aria-labelledby="technical-work-title">
    <div class="slide-inner summary-slide tech-summary-slide">
      <h2 id="technical-work-title">{t('这些技术工作保护了实验结论能被追溯、比较和恢复', 'These engineering layers keep the conclusions traceable, comparable, and recoverable')}</h2>
      <p class="slide-thesis">{t('这些技术工作分别保护一种实验性质：知道结果来自哪份代码、确认两组真的只差一个变量、机器中断后不重跑，以及加速时不偷偷改变科学语义。', 'Each engineering layer protects a different experimental property: knowing exactly which code produced a result, keeping comparisons one-variable, resuming without replay, and speeding up without silently changing scientific semantics.')}</p>
      <ol class="technical-proof-grid">
        <li><span>01</span><div><strong>{t('为了可追溯', 'Traceability')}</strong><p>{t('每次运行都记下代码版本、配置文件指纹、W&B 运行编号和实验记录。以后看到一个数字，可以一路查回它到底来自哪份代码和哪批数据。', 'Bind every run to a Git commit SHA, config / payload SHA256, W&B run identity, and ledger receipts so a number can be traced back to its code and data.')}</p></div></li>
        <li><span>02</span><div><strong>{t('为了公平比较', 'Causal comparability')}</strong><p>{t('冻结起点、随机种子、任务顺序和实验规则；并在同一块 GPU 上重复检查，确认“重复跑一遍出现差异”不会被误当成方法效果。', 'Freeze the start, random seeds, task order, and experiment rules; repeat runs on the same GPU to make sure hardware variation is not mistaken for a method effect.')}</p></div></li>
        <li><span>03</span><div><strong>{t('为了中断后还能原地继续', 'Recoverability')}</strong><p>{t('训练中断时，会同时保存检查点、归档和恢复记录；恢复前先核对模型状态，避免把已经做完的任务再跑一遍、把预算算两次。', 'Checkpoint, archive, transaction receipts, resume, and recovery are chained together; state SHAs are checked before recovery so completed rollouts are not consumed twice.')}</p></div></li>
        <li><span>04</span><div><strong>{t('为了排除动作接口这个隐藏变量', 'Action-interface validity')}</strong><p>{t('把动作执行框架、动作解析、合法动作限制和不会冲突的动作编码修清楚，才能把“模型不会做”和“动作格式坏了”分开。', 'Harness, parser, ActionPrefixConstraint, and injective action encoding separate model failure from a broken action interface.')}</p></div></li>
        <li><span>05</span><div><strong>{t('为了长跑不被实现细节卡住', 'Long-run continuity')}</strong><p>{t('“最多 64 个参数组件”的代码上限单独做验证；解除这个工程限制时，其他实验规则全部保持不变。', 'Qualify SD-LoRA component capacity separately; remove the 64-component implementation cap while leaving the rest of the experiment contract unchanged.')}</p></div></li>
        <li><span>06</span><div><strong>{t('为了加速但不改科学语义', 'Safe speedup')}</strong><p>{t('多模型并行只改运行速度，不改实验内容；恢复时还会检查“已经完成的正式任务没有被重复执行”。这样可以提高 GPU 利用率，同时保证前后仍是同一个实验。', 'Run models in parallel only to save time, not to change the experiment; recovery checks also verify that completed formal tasks are not repeated. This improves GPU use while keeping the experiment the same.')}</p></div></li>
      </ol>
      <p class="source-note"><a href={technicalHref}>{t('查看完整技术证据', 'Open the full technical evidence')}</a></p>
      <p class="slide-number">22 / 23</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section id="next" class="briefing-slide briefing-final" aria-labelledby="next-title">
    <div class="slide-inner">
      <h2 id="next-title">{t('DirectApply 先按原合同跑完 R160；下一条实验只改学习材料的选择', 'Finish DirectApply unchanged through R160; the next experiment changes only learning-material selection')}</h2>
      <p class="slide-thesis">{t('当前这条 DirectApply 长跑中途不再改抽题方式、奖励或更新规则，这样前后才是同一个实验。下一条实验再单独改变“哪些题得到更多尝试机会”；这样每次仍然只回答一个问题。', 'Do not change task sampling, reward, or update rules midway through the current DirectApply run. That keeps the whole run as one experiment. The next experiment changes only which tasks receive more attempts, so each experiment still answers one question.')}</p>
      <div class="choice-grid">
        <div class="choice current-line"><span>{t('当前线', 'CURRENT RUN')}</span><h3>{t('DirectApply 原样跑到 R160', 'Run DirectApply unchanged through R160')}</h3><p>{t('留下干净的长周期证据。训练结束前继续锁住冻结终评；训练中的每轮分数也只当训练过程，不当作最终正式成绩。', 'Keep a clean long-run record. The frozen final stays locked until training ends, and scores seen during training are not treated as the final result.')}</p></div>
        <div class="choice successor-line"><span>{t('下一条实验', 'NEXT EXPERIMENT')}</span><h3>{t('把更多探索机会给“差一点就会”的难题', 'Give more exploration to hard tasks that are close to success')}</h3><p>{t('保持每轮 128 次任务尝试的总预算不变，只改变哪些题更容易拿到新的尝试机会：优先那些已经接近成功、但还没完全做对的难题。若仍然平台，再把“让部分得分参与学习”和“用偏好反馈学习”分别做成新的单变量实验。', 'Keep the same budget of 128 task attempts per round and change only which tasks receive more attempts, prioritizing hard tasks that are close to success. If the plateau remains, test learning from partial scores and learning from preference feedback as separate experiments.')}</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="final-order" aria-label={t('下一步执行顺序', 'Execution order')}>
        <span><b>01</b>{t('DirectApply 原样跑到 R160', 'Run DirectApply unchanged through R160')}</span>
        <i aria-hidden="true">→</i>
        <span><b>02</b>{t('R160 正式封口并获得终评授权后，只打开一次冻结终评', 'After R160 is sealed and final-eval access is authorized, open the frozen final once')}</span>
        <i aria-hidden="true">→</i>
        <span><b>03</b>{t('再经单独预注册和授权，启动下一条单变量实验', 'Then preregister and separately authorize the next one-variable experiment')}</span>
      </div>
      <p class="final-source"><a href={flowHref}>{t('实验流程', 'Experiment flow')}</a> · <a href={technicalHref}>{t('技术推导与实验严谨性', 'Technical derivations and rigor')}</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</article>

<script is:inline>
  const syncBriefingScale = () => {
    const deck = document.querySelector('[data-testid="progress-briefing"]');
    if (!(deck instanceof HTMLElement)) return;
    const availableWidth = Math.min(1280, deck.clientWidth);
    const scale = availableWidth / 1280;
    deck.style.setProperty('--deck-scale', String(scale));
    deck.style.setProperty('--scaled-deck-w', `${availableWidth}px`);
    deck.style.setProperty('--scaled-deck-h', `${720 * scale}px`);
  };
  syncBriefingScale();
  window.addEventListener('resize', syncBriefingScale, { passive: true });
  window.visualViewport?.addEventListener('resize', syncBriefingScale, { passive: true });
</script>

